ped. Kusociński won the gold medal when he kicked past Iso-Hollo on the final curve, and was well ahead before slowing down in the stretch. Iso-Hollo would return six days later to win the " [:a {:href "/results/58010"} "steeplechase"] " gold medal. The precise placements after 6th are disputed, but the version we use is the most accepted."] "\n\n" [:p {} "During World War II, Kusociński worked for the Polish resistance. He was discovered by the Gestapo in March 1940 and was arrested and tortured, and eventually executed on 21 June 1940."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "364"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/74775"} "Janusz Kusociński"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/POL"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/POL.png"}] "POL"]] [:td {} "30:11.4"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "Olympic Record"} "OR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "117"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/67601"} "Volmari Iso-Hollo"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FIN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FIN.png"}] "FIN"]] [:td {} "30:12.6"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "139"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/67874"} "Lasse Virtanen"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FIN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FIN.png"}] "FIN"]] [:td {} "30:35.0"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td 